{
  "info": {
    "name": "OE Runtime API",
    "description": "OE Runtime HTTP server endpoints. Start the server with: oe-runtime --serve --config oe-config.json",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3333",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "your-secret-api-key",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "health"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Liveness check — returns runtime version."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Run Agent (inline YAML)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"yaml\": \"name: Hello World\\nsteps:\\n  - name: Say hello\\n    content: Say hello world\",\n  \"params\": {},\n  \"input\": \"run\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/run",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "run"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Run an agent by passing YAML inline.\n\nReturns:\n  { success, agent, output, pending_skill_chain, duration_ms }\n\n- pending_skill_chain: present when a manual skill is paused awaiting approval\n  { chain_id, skill_name } — use chain_id with POST /approve-chain to continue\n\nNote: skills: with relative SKILL.md paths require /run-file instead."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Run Agent (from file on disk)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"file\": \"/path/to/your/agent.yaml\",\n  \"params\": {},\n  \"input\": \"run\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/run-file",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "run-file"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Run an agent from a YAML file path on the server's disk.\n\nReturns:\n  { success, agent, output, pending_skill_chain, duration_ms }\n\n- pending_skill_chain: present when a manual skill is paused awaiting approval\n  { chain_id, skill_name } — use chain_id with POST /approve-chain to continue"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Approve Chain",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{api_key}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"chain_id\": \"{{chain_id}}\",\n  \"approved\": true,\n  \"abort\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/approve-chain",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "approve-chain"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Approve, skip, or abort a paused manual skill.\n\n  approved: true   — run the skill and continue\n  approved: false  — skip the skill and continue\n  abort: true      — stop the entire pipeline immediately\n\nGet chain_id from pending_skill_chain.chain_id in a /run or /run-file response.\nchain_id is one-time use — consumed on first call.\n\nReturns:\n  { success, approved, output, pending_skill_chain, duration_ms }\n\nIf pending_skill_chain is present, another skill is waiting — call /approve-chain again."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Skills",
      "description": "One request per sample agent — each sends the full agent YAML to POST /run.",
